[{"title":"草堂遣兴二首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"寥落生涯一草堂，草衣木食恣安详。\n烟花已许瀛洲并，日月偏随野兴长。\n渐止黄鹂将数侣，重来紫燕语青阳。\n从容久拟陶潜宅，懒懈无心学楚狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3411,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂遣兴二首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"卧病青山空复春，每依杖履惜芳辰。\n异世繁华那在眼，故园风景正相亲。\n穿花蛱蝶元相并，点水蜻蜓故傍人。\n传语风光共流转，百年清赏并吾真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3412,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林亭书怀三首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"林下春晴生事微，芳亭野色静年晖。\n桃花照日伤心丽，鹤鹭和风傍晚归。\n浪迹祇今频自得，甘情太古寂忘机。\n卧龙跃马终何事，故傍青门曳薜衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3413,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林亭书怀三首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"百岁生华转眼中，四时清兴与人同。\n渐将诗律酬杯酒，故着云衣舞薜空。\n僻地每宜开尺籍，幽禽长自语花丛。\n风清最爱春光好，直道无忧任转蓬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3414,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林亭书怀三首 其三","author":"林大钦","text":"木栏亭子并清幽，浪迹云馀迥不愁。\n谩把钓竿从许子，羞将服食拟浮丘。\n卉巾葛服春相问，碧水丹山时独游。\n看玩晴光移白日，好将吾道付沧洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3415,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晴","author":"林大钦","text":"花发烟晴春事宜，风和日暖迥春姿。\n百年事业惟杯酒，四海烟尘何所之。\n帘户静应通乳燕，幽怀不负采芳期。\n白沙翠竹青蓑里，一曲沧浪有所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3416,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓬门二首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"蓬门阒寂稀来往，日日幽怀对薜萝。\n静检云篇抽远思，閒看鸟翼一相过。\n江湖荏苒风烟迥，日月逶迤春色和。\n定与鹿门同出处，不妨杯酒付清歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3417,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蓬门二首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"吾生自谓巢居子，绝迹丘园澄物牵。\n杖履春风禽对语，逍遥日月花晴眠。\n繁华过眼须臾事，木石无心百岁缘。\n祇此清閒超世网，何须阆苑访神仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3418,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永夏","author":"林大钦","text":"荆扉俗远怜幽僻，永夏无心祇昼眠。\n桃李不言通鸟道，莺花寥落自风烟。\n侧身天地更怀古，回首云泉甘寂然。\n尘世漫留风格在，逍遥拟赋卜居篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3419,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吾乡","author":"林大钦","text":"吾乡风俗自淳古，直道时存畎亩民。\n衣服不殊天朴在，藩篱剖析话情亲。\n粤歌鲁酒春相问，云榻烟蓑老傍人。\n故凭童冠将桑梓，浴水风雩语性真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3420,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"衡门","author":"林大钦","text":"投老衡门不用名，此身长与一鸥轻。\n浮生扰扰非吾意，底事悠悠空世营。\n混迹渔樵频自得，凭谁风月竞多清。\n云白山青共予好，百年怀土迥深情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3421,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"甘雨","author":"林大钦","text":"六月六日苦炎热，翻然一雨疑清秋。\n田鸡水鹳欢并得，对酒狂歌可自由。\n浮生不问黄金产，尘世惟应囊药谋。\n便与渔樵同出处，九天云路泛虚舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3422,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀","author":"林大钦","text":"幽栖日觉喧纷远，独坐随忘世上名。\n把酒看山了何事，芃兰丛菊时争清。\n乾坤宿业诗书在，日月无心节序更。\n尤事蹉跎尘雾里，百年杖锡慰深情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3423,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"高楼对月","author":"林大钦","text":"高楼夜寂凉风发，独对南屏看月明。\n万里星河光不动，百年清景慰吾生。\n天空过雁闻秋信，露重垂珠滴叶鸣。\n暂学楚狂歌彩凤，五陵衣马自肥轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3424,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居二首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"清斋独坐思閒閒，孤松幽竹长相关。\n长空飞鸟向何处，霁日孤云时往还。\n杖履久牵沧海梦，风流拟住紫霞间。\n飘零生业馀多少，静倚青门笑碧山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3425,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"他日事主曾无赖，欲写狂言献至尊。\n而今篱落缘生事，浑却悲欢到我门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3426,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"流落生涯李杜怜，狂童车马正翩跹。\n即教富贵从人得，何事沧洲泛蠡船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3427,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其三","author":"林大钦","text":"陶潜曾作归来人，卧稳柴桑太古春。\n却遗秀句存青史，未绝风流漉酒巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3428,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其四","author":"林大钦","text":"长公直道嗟难同，仲理风高起泽中。\n虚疑富贵由来事，熟记当年失马翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3429,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其五","author":"林大钦","text":"最传秀发王维词，窃信风流亦我师。\n行到水穷浑自事，坐看云起更相宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3430,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其六","author":"林大钦","text":"吟诗岂必耽佳句，饮酒应须会性真。\n好记襄阳庞处士，閒过江湖一百春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3431,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其七","author":"林大钦","text":"极目青濛鸟道天，飞沉今古谁差贤。\n柴门胜事花如锦，我自吟诗看月眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3432,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其八","author":"林大钦","text":"已见繁华悲眼前，又闻陵谷变桑田。\n南州野士居郑谷，不吃鱼粱吃紫烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3433,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其九","author":"林大钦","text":"南州花竹暮春光，听鸟问花幽事长。\n谁将造次嗤荣辱，吾欲此地老行藏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3434,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其十","author":"林大钦","text":"青榴丹橘春冬天，课酒行歌意醒然。\n薄俗谩通人意过，冥将物理信流年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3435,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其十一","author":"林大钦","text":"茅堂竹径来人稀，乌鹊行云他自归。\n南畦少摘葵花菜，北牖开尊问翠微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3436,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣兴十二首 其十二","author":"林大钦","text":"翠屏幽竹静相亲，白眼科头酒后春。\n病我迂疏慵世会，不是东西南北人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3437,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂看花十二首 其一","author":"林大钦","text":"手栽数种细青青，忽蔓堂阶刺眼明。\n东风不费吹嘘力，好向春时却尽生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3438,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂看花十二首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"初觉花开三两枝，便看烂熳更相宜。\n从今难却春风意，日日花前醉酒卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3439,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂看花十二首 其三","author":"林大钦","text":"无赖春色太增情，枝枝叶叶向人倾。\n每愁风雨殊烦恼，却怪雨中花迥明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3440,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂看花十二首 其四","author":"林大钦","text":"最喜一庭开九里，可怜天棘蔓青丝。\n閒英细撷浑无数，开合纷纷祇自宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3441,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂看花十二首 其五","author":"林大钦","text":"芄榴株槿漫从遮，细认红花间白花。\n荡跌幽人无限意，春风美酒送生涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3442,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂看花十二首 其六","author":"林大钦","text":"且从诸种问风流，休怪紫荆最后抽。\n试看红艳倾阳日，乱蕊繁英何处求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3443,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂看花十二首 其七","author":"林大钦","text":"纵然花发春将遍，兰子丛萱各擅芳。\n一夜小塘深雨露，莲枝又放数根香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3444,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂看花十二首 其八","author":"林大钦","text":"凌霄绣蕊蔓青空，未若东堂一丈红。\n却怜夜合矜幽色，独纵艳香度晚风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":3445,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂看花十二首 其九","author":"林大钦","text":"枝英秀发亦擅场，银白金黄细细香。\n一种幽情吹不尽，世人虚重百花王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00